Journey: Rate a risk on the MyCover quote screen
Id: quote-on-portal
Tags: @library
Description: Reusable sub-journey: fills the quote form, reads the breakdown and returns it with the quote reference.
Params: product, sumInsured, regionLabel, riskAge, noClaimsYears
Returns: premium, quoteRef

Open /app/quote
  Expect the page contains "Get a quote"
Select "${product}" from the Product dropdown
Fill the "Sum insured (GBP)" field with ${sumInsured}
Select "${regionLabel}" from the Region dropdown
Fill css=#riskAge with ${riskAge}
Fill the "No-claims years" field with ${noClaimsYears}
Click the "Calculate premium" button
  Expect the page contains "Premium breakdown"
Read the premium breakdown into premium
Capture the text of testid=quote-ref as quoteRef
